---
import Page from '../components/Page.astro';
---
<Page title="Cookie Policy" section="Legal" path="/cookies/" description="Navigator Coast does not set cookies or store anything on your device."
  sources={[
    { title: 'Directive 2002/58/EC (ePrivacy Directive), Article 5(3)', url: 'https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dir/2002/58/oj' },
    { title: "UK Information Commissioner's Office: Cookies and similar technologies", url: 'https://ico.org.uk/for-organisations/direct-marketing-and-privacy-and-electronic-communications/guide-to-pecr/cookies-and-similar-technologies/' },
  ]}>
  <h2>The short version</h2>
  <p>Navigator Coast does not set cookies and does not store anything on your device. You will not see a cookie banner here because there is nothing to consent to.</p>
  <h2>Other storage</h2>
  <p>This site does not use analytics scripts, local storage, session storage, fingerprinting, advertising pixels or social media plugins. Its fonts and images are served from our own domain.</p>
  <h2>Sites we link to</h2>
  <p>Operator websites, official sources and the Tourground directory are separate websites with their own cookie policies, which apply when you visit them.</p>
  <h2>If this changes</h2>
  <p>If we ever add a cookie or similar technology that is not strictly necessary, we will ask for your consent first where the law requires it, and update this page.</p>
</Page>
